  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility study and pilot for tracing, sourcing and recycling plastic waste in Nigeria and Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower was founded in 2018 and specialises in the collection and separation of plastic waste, using an ICT solution powered by blockchain. Empower is enabling a cost-efficient, reliable and replicable system of sourcing of recycled plastics, with fully traceable materials and impact data.
Empower will conduct a feasibility study in Nigeria and Tanzania, and conduct  a small pilot based on these funds.</narrative>
  </description>
